# jemdoc: menu{MENU}{index.html}, nofooter  
= Jingyang (William) Zhu | 朱敬阳

~~~
{}{img_left}{./photos/zjz2025.jpg}{alt text}{150}{210.4}{}
Hello everyone! I received my Ph.D. at [https://sist.shanghaitech.edu.cn School of Information Science and Technology (SIST)], [https://www.shanghaitech.edu.cn ShanghaiTech University] advised by Prof. [https://shiyuanming.github.io/ Yuanming Shi], majoring in Computer Science (CS).

I am currently a researcher in AI-Flow, the Institue of Artificial Intelligence, China Telecom (TeleAI), under the direction of Prof. [https://shaojiawei07.github.io/index.html/ Jiaowei Shao] and Prof. [http://xuelongli.cn/ Xuelong Li] (Chief Technology Officer and Chief Scientist of China Telecom, and the director of TeleAI).

I was also in internship with the Nokia Bell Labs, Shanghai, China, May to September, 2025.

Earlier, I received my bachelor's degree in Electronic and Information Engineering from [https://see.xidian.edu.cn/ School of Electronic Engineering (SEE)], Xidian University, in 2021.

My current research interest lies in edge large AI models (LAMs), in particular end-edge-cloud collaborative LAM inference and compression as well as their applications to satellite edge AI and space computing power networks \[[https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=eK45gbMAAAAJ&hl=en Google Scholar]\].

#You can find my CV [files/cv.pdf here].

